  "notes": "Australian Army plus Army Aviation. Player relations are a proposal (friendly, purchases at higher rep than USA/GBR/CAN). Large transition 2024-2029: Abrams SEP v3, Boxer CRV, AH-64E, UH-60M, HIMARS in; Tiger, Taipan, M113AS4 out. Expelled Iran's ambassador in August 2025; recognised the State of Palestine in September 2025.",
